  "fullDescription": "🍼 Modern Baby – Playful & Bubbly Display Font ✨\nSay hello to Modern Baby, a super-cute and chunky display font designed to bring a burst of joy to your creative projects! With its thick, rounded, and bubbly letterforms, this font captures the essence of childhood fun and modern simplicity.\n\nIt’s the ultimate choice for designers and crafters looking to create something soft yet bold. From nursery wall art to playful branding, Modern Baby stands out with its friendly personality and high legibility.\n\n🎨 Perfect For:\n\n👶 Nursery Decor & Baby Room Wall Art\n🧸 Toy Packaging & Kids’ Brand Identity\n👕 Kids’ Apparel (T-shirts, Onesies, & Hoodies)\n🎂 Birthday Invitations & Party Stationery\n✂️ Cricut & Silhouette Crafting & Stickers\n🍎 Teacher Resources & Classroom Posters\n💖 Sublimation & DIY Gift Projects\n\nMake your designs pop with the adorable charm of Modern Baby!",
